main human-reviewed proposals.","Do not treat readiness score, email engagement, or a submitted draft as provider approval."],"stopConditions":["suppression or permission breach","fabricated material fact","provider-criteria mismatch","duplicate case attribution","material claim regression"],"targetOutcomeObservable":true,"verifiedOutcomeRule":"Count once when a submitted capital_cases record transitions to ready_for_provider_review and the corresponding event and readiness evidence are present."},"owner_contract_json":{"automationRole":"vestblock_application","crmAuthority":"vestblock_crm","dispatchAuthority":"none_in_gate_3b","handoffRules":["No provider receives a case without separate sharing permission and operator approval.","The receiving strategy must persist acceptance before it owns the next action."],"humanOwner":"A VestBlock operator owns material readiness review, provider sharing, and provider introductions.","recordOwner":"Capital case service owns capital_cases and capital_case_events."},"required_current_status":"draft","source_provenance_json":[{"kind":"gate_3a_registry_seed","observedAt":"2026-08-15","source":"Gate 3A canonical governed registry"},{"kind":"founder_approved_architecture","observedAt":"2026-08-15","source":"Gate 2 canonical strategy registry"},{"kind":"repository_consumer_audit","observedAt":"2026-08-15","source":"capital_cases/capital_case_events consumer audit"}],"strategy_key":"capital_readiness_intake"},{"activation_blockers":["Version 1 remains draft and has no founder-approved activation event.","External send capacity is zero and no live-send approval exists.","Gate 3C canonical consumer binding is not implemented.","Attribution from a published content asset to a completed approved customer path is not yet authoritative.","Per-asset destination and CTA snapshots, founder-approved Buffer publishing, and source-dependent refresh enforcement are incomplete."],"automation_owner_key":"vestblock_application","contract_json":{"activationReadiness":{"blockers":["Canonical operating-strategy version binding is absent.","Per-asset destination, CTA, source, review, and refresh snapshots are incomplete.","Current ready-to-published and auto-publish paths bypass the required human review and exact-version approval guard.","Attribution from a published content asset to a completed approved customer path is not yet authoritative.","Buffer and digest publishing remain unapproved with zero send capacity."],"readyElements":["Research briefs and content assets exist.","The default /next-move route and CTA are approved when no specific destination applies.","The approved channel vocabulary limits social publishing to buffer_vestblock."],"status":"blocked"},"cadenceSteps":[{"channels":["operator_task","no_outreach"],"condition":"A current authoritative source materially affects an approved VestBlock audience or customer decision.","purpose":"Create or update a sourced research brief and flag material changes for review.","timing":"daily intelligence intake"},{"channels":["operator_task"],"condition":"A brief or asset is new, changed, approaching source expiry, or showing a material quality or compliance signal.","purpose":"Review evidence, claims, financial literacy, audience intent, destination, CTA, and refresh SLA.","timing":"weekly editorial review"},{"channels":["website_notification","buffer_vestblock"],"condition":"The exact asset, claims, sources, destination, CTA, channel copy, and VestBlock-owned social profile are approved and no send or publication guardrail is open.","purpose":"Publish the canonical asset and, only in a later activated version, distribute an approved social variant.","timing":"after human approval and live-destination verification"},{"channels":["operator_task","no_outreach"],"condition":"A material source expires, changes, conflicts, or can no longer substantiate the published claim.","purpose":"Reverify, revise, return to draft, archive, or retire the asset.","timing":"at source-specific refresh due date"}],"channelSelectionRules":["Publish the canonical asset on a VestBlock-owned website route only after editorial and claim review.","Use buffer_vestblock only for official VestBlock-owned social profiles, an approved asset, an exact destination snapshot, and a founder-approved channel version.","Use Resend only for a separately opted-in digest; PR or sensitive-topic outreach becomes an operator task and never inherits website permission."],"complianceLimits":["Do not guarantee funding, approval, credit-score change, deletion, income, investment return, property availability, government award, deal outcome, or transaction timing.","Keep analysis, matching, marketing, provider sharing, public display, and outreach permissions separate and purpose-specific.","Recheck global suppression, DNC, withdrawal, complaint, hard bounce, identity conflict, and destination health immediately before any later dispatch.","Cite authoritative sources near material claims and preserve source/version provenance.","Do not publish internal strategy language, fabricated proof, anonymous unverifiable claims, copied work, or generic AI-slop.","Only VestBlock-owned social profiles may be selected in Buffer, and no channel permission may be inferred from website engagement."],"crossLaneRoutes":[{"handoff":"Snapshot /next-move and its CTA on the approved asset version; Next Move independently owns intake and conversion.","requiresReceivingStrategyAcceptance":true,"to":"next_move_free_roadmap","trigger":"An educational asset has no more specific approved customer path."},{"handoff":"Snapshot the approved Capital destination and let Capital independently qualify the visitor.","requiresReceivingStrategyAcceptance":true,"to":"capital_readiness_intake","trigger":"A cited asset answers a capital-preparation question and the reviewed next step is Capital."},{"handoff":"Snapshot the secure credit destination without making a repair, deletion, or score claim.","requiresReceivingStrategyAcceptance":true,"to":"credit_education_support","trigger":"A cited educational asset appropriately leads to secure credit-report review."},{"handoff":"Snapshot the demo destination and distinguish content interest from demo qualification and product activation.","requiresReceivingStrategyAcceptance":true,"to":"dealvault_activation","trigger":"A verified coordination-use-case asset appropriately leads to a private DealVault demo."}],"disqualificationCriteria":["Fabricated proof, anonymous unverifiable sourcing, stale material facts, copied content, internal operating language, or generic AI-slop.","Unreviewed financial, credit, investment, legal, tax, case-study, performance, or affiliate claim.","Missing or broken destination, missing CTA, unsupported audience intent, or an asset that cannot be refreshed responsibly."],"eligibilityCriteria":["The asset is supported by a current primary or authoritative source and a reviewable research brief.","Audience intent, VestBlock relevance, claims, statistics, content version, destination, CTA, and refresh date are explicit.","The destination is live and approved; use /next-move only when no more specific approved path applies."],"failureConditions":["Stale or contradicted source","Unsubstantiated or regulated claim","Broken or unsnapshotted destination","Unapproved CTA or social account","Internal language or AI-slop","Attribution ambiguity","Sustained zero qualified progression after adequate exposure"],"followupCadence":["Ingest current intelligence daily without auto-publishing a claim.","Run a weekly editorial review of briefs, claims, destinations, and refresh risk.","Evaluate a published asset only after at least 28 days of maturity inside each 56-day learning window.","Refresh or retire according to the most volatile material source rather than a generic calendar."],"handoffRules":["The content asset must snapshot the exact approved destination, CTA, content version, and source attribution before a customer-path handoff.","The receiving strategy independently owns eligibility, permission, lifecycle, communication, and conversion; a content click grants none of those authorities.","CRM may attribute a completed path back to content only through a governed immutable event, not referral inference alone."],"humanApprovalPoints":["Every material financial, credit, investment, legal, tax, regulatory, statistical, performance, or case-study claim","Research brief and source sufficiency","Asset readiness and publication","Destination and CTA","Affiliate or compensation disclosure","PR pitch or sensitive-topic outreach","Buffer social copy and VestBlock-owned account"],"integrationDependencies":[{"evidence":"Application consumers do not yet persist or resolve canonical operating-strategy version IDs.","integration":"canonical strategy-version binding","requiredBeforeActivation":true,"status":"gate_3c"},{"evidence":"content_assets persists draft, ready, published, and archived assets with publication timestamps and routes.","integration":"Content asset repository","requiredBeforeActivation":true,"status":"available"},{"evidence":"research_briefs exists as a research and continuous-improvement source, but each future asset still requires human evidence review.","integration":"Research brief repository","requiredBeforeActivation":true,"status":"available"},{"evidence":"No canonical immutable record currently binds every published asset version to an approved strategy destination, CTA, material sources, and refresh SLA.","integration":"Per-asset destination, CTA, and source snapshot","requiredBeforeActivation":true,"status":"missing"},{"evidence":"Current content delivery and engagement signals do not prove a qualified visitor completed an approved customer path.","integration":"Qualified customer-path attribution","requiredBeforeActivation":true,"status":"missing"},{"evidence":"Current publication paths can move a ready asset directly to published, including auto-publish behavior, without the reviewed and approved states required by this contract.","integration":"Human-review publication guard","requiredBeforeActivation":true,"status":"blocked"},{"evidence":"Buffer is limited by policy to VestBlock-owned profiles, but this draft has no approved live channel version or send capacity.","integration":"Buffer VestBlock-only publishing","requiredBeforeActivation":true,"status":"blocked"}],"learningInputs":["topic and customer question","source set and freshness","asset and content version","audience and format","destination and CTA snapshot","qualified visit","path start and verified completion","citation or visibility evidence","refresh outcome","claim or brand review result"],"nurtureRules":["Let the approved destination strategy own the customer journey after a reader enters its path.","A content digest may include only separately opted-in, relevant, current assets and may not infer interest from a page view.","Do not recycle traffic-only content that has no verified decision value, live destination, or accountable refresh owner."],"objective":"Turn current authoritative research into cited, financially literate content that answers a real customer question and moves qualified readers into one approved VestBlock path.","offer":"Reviewed educational content and market intelligence with explicit evidence, freshness, audience intent, destination, CTA, and regulated-claim boundaries.","primaryChannels":["website_notification","buffer_vestblock"],"prioritizationRules":["Prioritize high-consequence customer questions where a current authoritative answer removes a documented decision barrier.","Prefer topics with a specific approved customer path and measurable completion event over traffic-only opportunities.","Elevate material regulatory, market, product, security, or industry changes by source freshness and customer impact, never by sensational reach alone."],"problem":"Uncited, stale, generic, or internally worded content erodes trust and creates traffic that cannot be connected to a responsible customer decision.","reactivationRules":["Return an archived or retired topic to research only after new authoritative evidence and a current customer decision need are documented.","Republish only as a new reviewed asset version with a revalidated destination, CTA, claim set, and refresh date."],"secondaryChannels":["resend_email","operator_task","no_outreach"],"sourceData":["research_briefs","content_assets","primary and authoritative source URLs","content publication and indexing evidence","per-asset destination and CTA snapshot","qualified customer-path attribution events","Buffer VestBlock-owned profile delivery results"],"sourceDataRequirements":[{"authority":"VestBlock research and continuous-improvement repository","freshnessRule":"Recheck each material source on its documented volatility SLA and immediately after a known regulatory, product, price, eligibility, or market change.","requiredEvidence":["topic or theme","audience intent","authoritative sources","material claims","source dates","priority","review status"],"source":"research_briefs"},{"authority":"VestBlock content repository and content status fields","freshnessRule":"A published asset must carry a refresh date derived from its most volatile material source and must be archived or returned to draft when that evidence expires.","requiredEvidence":["asset ID","slug","content type","language","versioned body","draft/ready/published/archived status","published_at when published","review evidence"],"source":"content_assets"},{"authority":"Target Gate 3C content-attribution record; not yet authoritative","freshnessRule":"Validate the live destination immediately before publication and attribute only events tied to the immutable asset and strategy versions.","requiredEvidence":["content asset and version","approved destination and CTA snapshot","qualified visit","customer-path start","verified path completion","attribution window"],"source":"asset destination and conversion attribution"}],"stopRules":["Stop on opt-out, complaint, hard bounce, DNC, withdrawal, or permission loss.","Stop on a reply that needs human handling, a verified conversion, successful handoff, disqualification, or identity conflict.","Stop on stale evidence, an invalid destination, a missing strategy or message version, duplicate ownership, capacity failure, or a kill switch.","Unpublish, return to draft, archive, or retire an asset immediately when a material source, claim, destination, disclosure, or access boundary fails.","Stop social or digest distribution when the exact asset version is no longer approved or the destination changes."],"targetParticipant":"Prospective customers, participants, partners, and professionals seeking accurate guidance across capital, real estate, opportunity, DealVault, credit education, and business readiness.","valueExchange":"The audience receives useful cited education and a clear next step; VestBlock earns qualified attention, feedback, and permissioned progression into an approved customer path.","versionDecisionRule":{"autonomousMaterialChange":false,"promote":"Promote only after two complete 56-day windows each contain at least 12 approved published assets matured for 28 days and ten attributable completed customer paths, with no freshness, claim, destination, disclosure, complaint, or brand regression.","requiredCompleteWindows":2,"retire":"Retire an asset or topic after a material claim or source failure, a broken destination that cannot be repaired, or two complete windows without qualified progression after adequate mature exposure.","revise":"Revise a topic, format, source, destination, or CTA when attributable path progression and editorial evidence identify a bounded correctable issue."}},"crm_owner_key":"vestblock_crm","cta_label":"Build my free Next Move roadmap","destination_mode":"public_route","destination_path":"/next-move","execution_mode":"no_send","expected_current_version":1,"expected_prior_fingerprint":"f6a00c11fbbe4ec0bceac7ddf623e5d8","external_activation":"blocked","external_send_cap":0,"lifecycle_contract_json":{"cadence":["Daily sourced intelligence intake.","Weekly human editorial, claim, destination, and refresh review.","Asset evaluation after at least 28 days of maturity inside a 56-day window.","Refresh at the most volatile material source SLA."],"initialState":"draft","persistedEvents":["content asset created or updated","content asset marked ready","content asset published with published_at","content asset archived"],"persistedStates":["draft","ready","published","archived"],"recordAuthority":"content_assets currently owns draft, ready, published, and archived status; research_briefs stores research artifacts. Review/approval, indexing, qualified visits, customer-path attribution, refresh_due, and retired remain target lifecycle stages.","stateNotes":{"approved":"approved is target-only and is not currently persisted by content_assets/research_briefs; canonical review, destination snapshot, attribution, and refresh lifecycle are incomplete.","archived":"archived is persisted by content_assets/research_briefs; canonical review, destination snapshot, attribution, and refresh lifecycle are incomplete.","assisted_conversion":"assisted_conversion is target-only and is not currently persisted by content_assets/research_briefs; canonical review, destination snapshot, attribution, and refresh lifecycle are incomplete.","customer_path_started":"customer_path_started is target-only and is not currently persisted by content_assets/research_briefs; canonical review, destination snapshot, attribution, and refresh lifecycle are incomplete.","draft":"draft is persisted by content_assets/research_briefs; canonical review, destination snapshot, attribution, and refresh lifecycle are incomplete.","indexed":"indexed is target-only and is not currently persisted by content_assets/research_briefs; canonical review, destination snapshot, attribution, and refresh lifecycle are incomplete.","published":"published is persisted by content_assets/research_briefs; canonical review, destination snapshot, attribution, and refresh lifecycle are incomplete.","qualified_visit":"qualified_visit is target-only and is not currently persisted by content_assets/research_briefs; canonical review, destination snapshot, attribution, and refresh lifecycle are incomplete.","ready":"ready is persisted by content_assets/research_briefs; canonical review, destination snapshot, attribution, and refresh lifecycle are incomplete.","refresh_due":"refresh_due is target-only and is not currently persisted by content_assets/research_briefs; canonical review, destination snapshot, attribution, and refresh lifecycle are incomplete.","retired":"retired is target-only and is not currently persisted by content_assets/research_briefs; canonical review, destination snapshot, attribution, and refresh lifecycle are incomplete.","reviewed":"reviewed is target-only and is not currently persisted by content_assets/research_briefs; canonical review, destination snapshot, attribution, and refresh lifecycle are incomplete."},"states":["draft","ready","reviewed","approved","published","indexed","qualified_visit","customer_path_started","assisted_conversion","refresh_due","retired","archived"],"stopConditions":["assisted_conversion","retired","archived","material_source_stale","unsupported_claim","broken_destination","approval_withdrawn"],"targetOnlyStages":["reviewed","approved","indexed","qualified_visit","customer_path_started","assisted_conversion","refresh_due","retired"],"terminalStates":["assisted_conversion","retired","archived"],"transitions":[{"event":"content_asset_marked_ready","from":"draft","persistence":"current","to":"ready"},{"event":"draft_content_asset_archived","from":"draft","persistence":"current","to":"archived"},{"event":"editorial_and_claim_review_completed","from":"ready","persistence":"target_only","to":"reviewed"},{"event":"current_content_asset_published","from":"ready","persistence":"current","to":"published"},{"event":"ready_content_asset_archived","from":"ready","persistence":"current","to":"archived"},{"event":"content_asset_approved_for_exact_destination","from":"reviewed","persistence":"target_only","to":"approved"},{"event":"reviewed_content_asset_returned_for_revision","from":"reviewed","persistence":"target_only","to":"draft"},{"event":"approved_content_version_published","from":"approved","persistence":"target_only","to":"published"},{"event":"approval_withdrawn_for_revision","from":"approved","persistence":"target_only","to":"draft"},{"event":"published_asset_indexing_verified","from":"published","persistence":"target_only","to":"indexed"},{"event":"qualified_direct_visit_attributed","from":"published","persistence":"target_only","to":"qualified_visit"},{"event":"published_asset_source_refresh_due","from":"published","persistence":"target_only","to":"refresh_due"},{"event":"published_content_asset_archived","from":"published","persistence":"current","to":"archived"},{"event":"indexed_asset_qualified_visit_attributed","from":"indexed","persistence":"target_only","to":"qualified_visit"},{"event":"indexed_asset_material_source_expires","from":"indexed","persistence":"target_only","to":"refresh_due"},{"event":"visitor_starts_snapshotted_customer_path","from":"qualified_visit","persistence":"target_only","to":"customer_path_started"},{"event":"qualified_path_destination_or_source_expires","from":"qualified_visit","persistence":"target_only","to":"refresh_due"},{"event":"attributed_customer_path_completed","from":"customer_path_started","persistence":"target_only","to":"assisted_conversion"},{"event":"started_path_attribution_window_expires","from":"customer_path_started","persistence":"target_only","to":"refresh_due"},{"event":"asset_returned_to_draft_for_refresh","from":"refresh_due","persistence":"target_only","to":"draft"},{"event":"content_asset_retired_after_refresh_review","from":"refresh_due","persistence":"target_only","to":"retired"}]},"outcome_contract_json":{"attributionDimensions":["portfolio","operating strategy version","content asset and version","topic","audience","source","channel","destination and CTA","receiving strategy","completed path"],"businessValue":"Lower-cost qualified acquisition, stronger trust and authority, current customer education, and increased demand for responsible VestBlock paths.","exposureUnit":"approved_published_assets_matured_28_days","leadingIndicators":["approved research briefs","reviewed content assets","published assets matured 28 days","source freshness","qualified visits","CTA engagement","approved path starts","indexing and citation evidence"],"learningInputs":["operating strategy version","asset and content version","topic","audience","source set and dates","format and channel","destination and CTA snapshot","qualified visit","path start","verified completion","refresh result"],"learningWindowDays":56,"minimumExposure":12,"minimumPrimaryConversions":10,"observableCurrentOutcome":{"available":false,"evidence":"content_assets and research_briefs can prove research and publication artifacts, while delivery and engagement systems provide only leading signals.","limitation":"Attribution from a published content asset to a completed approved customer path is not yet authoritative."},"primaryConversionEvent":"A qualified visitor attributable to an approved content version enters and completes the asset's snapshotted approved customer path.","requiredCompleteWindows":2,"safeguards":["Require two complete learning windows before recommending promotion.","Do not declare a winner from opens, clicks, or other vanity engagement alone.","A complaint, compliance failure, identity conflict, duplicate dispatch, or suppression breach blocks promotion.","Material audience, offer, cadence, claim, destination, or channel changes remain human-reviewed proposals.","Do not count publishing, indexing, impressions, page views, opens, social engagement, CTA clicks, or path starts as a completed customer path.","Exclude an asset from the exposure denominator until it is approved, published, and matured for 28 days with a live destination."],"stopConditions":["source freshness failure","unsupported or regulated claim","broken destination","approval withdrawal","brand or AI-slop regression","complaint or disclosure failure","attribution integrity failure"],"targetOutcomeObservable":false,"verifiedOutcomeRule":"Count once when an immutable content asset/version and approved destination/CTA snapshot are joined through governed attribution to a receiving-strategy-verified customer-path completion inside the declared window."},"owner_contract_json":{"automationRole":"vestblock_application","crmAuthority":"vestblock_crm","dispatchAuthority":"none_in_gate_3b","handoffRules":["Content hands off only the approved asset/destination/CTA attribution context; it never transfers or infers customer permission.","The receiving strategy owns qualification and conversion, and CRM may return only a verified attributed completion outcome to content learning."],"humanOwner":"A VestBlock editor owns claims, sources, financial literacy, brand quality, publication, destination, CTA, disclosure, and channel approval.","recordOwner":"The content service owns research briefs, content assets, source provenance, publication state, destination snapshots, and refresh tasks; CRM must own future immutable path attribution."},"required_current_status":"draft","source_provenance_json":[{"kind":"gate_3a_registry_seed","observedAt":"2026-08-15","source":"Gate 3A canonical governed registry"},{"kind":"founder_approved_architecture","observedAt":"2026-08-15","source":"Gate 2 canonical strategy registry"},{"kind":"repository_consumer_audit","observedAt":"2026-08-15","source":"content_assets, research_briefs, publication, indexing, Buffer, and customer-path attribution consumer audit"}],"strategy_key":"content_authority_intelligence"},{"activation_blockers":["Version 1 remains draft and has no founder-approved activation event.","External send capacity is zero and no live-send approval exists.","Gate 3C canonical consumer binding is not implemented.","Primary saved-plan outcome is not currently observable after credit analysis completion.","Credit-report handling and any dispute support require explicit authorization and strict educational claim boundaries."],"automation_owner_key":"vestblock_application","contract_json":{"activationReadiness":{"blockers":["Canonical strategy-version binding is absent.","Primary outcome is not currently observable as an analysis-ready report with a customer-saved action plan.","Customer action progress is not persisted.","External educational follow-up remains unapproved."],"readyElements":["/credit-upload exists.","The credit workflow persists exact processing statuses.","Operator review tasks and transactional status notifications exist."],"status":"blocked"},"cadenceSteps":[{"channels":["website_notification","resend_email"],"condition":"The authorized upload was persisted.","purpose":"Confirm secure report receipt.","timing":"immediate"},{"channels":["website_notification","operator_task","resend_email"],"condition":"No sensitive report content is placed in email.","purpose":"Provide a bounded status next step.","timing":"on completed, failed, or needs_review"},{"channels":["website_notification","resend_email"],"condition":"Separate follow-up permission exists.","purpose":"Check educational action progress.","timing":"customer-selected days 7, 30, 60, and 90"}],"channelSelectionRules":["Use secure website surfaces for report data and analysis.","Use transactional email for receipt/completion only; never include sensitive report detail.","Use an operator task for needs_review or an edge case."],"complianceLimits":["Do not guarantee funding, approval, credit-score change, deletion, income, investment return, property availability, government award, deal outcome, or transaction timing.","Keep analysis, matching, marketing, provider sharing, public display, and outreach permissions separate and purpose-specific.","Recheck global suppression, DNC, withdrawal, complaint, hard bounce, identity conflict, and destination health immediately before any later dispatch.","Dispute tools are customer-directed educational documents, not a promise of bureau, creditor, legal, or score outcomes.","Never ingest a report without customer authorization."],"crossLaneRoutes":[{"handoff":"Start a separate Capital case; do not share report data automatically.","requiresReceivingStrategyAcceptance":true,"to":"capital_readiness_intake","trigger":"The customer completes relevant readiness actions and requests a capital review."},{"handoff":"Offer a new roadmap without exposing report detail.","requiresReceivingStrategyAcceptance":true,"to":"next_move_free_roadmap","trigger":"The customer needs broader sequencing beyond credit."}],"disqualificationCriteria":["Unauthorized report or identity conflict.","Request for guaranteed deletion, score improvement, funding, approval, legal outcome, or timeline.","A matter requiring licensed legal or other professional advice beyond the supported education boundary."],"eligibilityCriteria":["Authenticated customer owns or is authorized to use the uploaded report.","Explicit analysis permission and source date are present.","The report can be processed securely and the requested support stays educational."],"failureConditions":["Unauthorized access","Sensitive-data exposure","Extraction/analysis failure","Unsupported claim","Missing saved-plan event"],"followupCadence":["Immediate secure receipt confirmation.","Status notification when analysis completes or needs review.","Customer-selected educational checkpoints at days 7, 30, 60, and 90."],"handoffRules":["Credit support owns secure analysis and education.","Another strategy receives only the minimum permissioned readiness facts, never the report by default."],"humanApprovalPoints":["Identity or report-authorization concern","Dispute/legal edge case","Low-confidence or contradictory analysis","Any score, deletion, funding, or timeline statement"],"integrationDependencies":[{"evidence":"Application consumers do not yet persist or resolve canonical operating-strategy version IDs.","integration":"canonical strategy-version binding","requiredBeforeActivation":true,"status":"gate_3c"},{"evidence":"credit_reports and creditRepairWorkflow persist uploaded through completed/failed/needs_review.","integration":"Credit report workflow","requiredBeforeActivation":true,"status":"available"},{"evidence":"No canonical saved plan/progress event proves the target conversion after analysis_ready.","integration":"Customer action-plan persistence","requiredBeforeActivation":true,"status":"missing"}],"learningInputs":["workflow stage time","extraction failure","needs-review reason","confusing section","selected action","plan save","checkpoint","customer-reported progress"],"nurtureRules":["Nurture follows customer-selected educational actions only.","Do not market credit repair outcomes or convert transactional notices into marketing."],"objective":"Help a customer understand an authorized credit report and organize bounded educational actions without guaranteeing deletion, score change, approval, or timing.","offer":"Secure upload, report analysis, issue organization, educational next actions, and operator review for edge cases.","primaryChannels":["website_notification","operator_task"],"prioritizationRules":["Process securely received reports in timestamp order.","Escalate extraction ambiguity, identity concern, legal issue, or low-confidence analysis to needs_review.","Do not prioritize by score range or protected status."],"problem":"Credit reports are difficult to interpret, and incomplete context can produce risky claims, unauthorized access, or inappropriate actions.","reactivationRules":["Reactivate after a new authorized report or explicit customer request.","Identity/data-access concern or deletion request prevents reactivation."],"secondaryChannels":["resend_email","no_outreach"],"sourceData":["credit_reports","creditRepairWorkflow status updates","customer-uploaded report","analysis_json","system events and review tasks"],"sourceDataRequirements":[{"authority":"Credit workflow service","freshnessRule":"Treat the report as a dated snapshot and request a new authorized upload for later bureau changes.","requiredEvidence":["user ID","authorized file","status","status timestamps","analysis result or failure reason"],"source":"credit_reports and creditRepairWorkflow"},{"authority":"Target CRM events not yet implemented","freshnessRule":"Use only customer-confirmed action and progress events.","requiredEvidence":["selected action","saved timestamp","checkpoint","customer feedback"],"source":"customer action-plan selection and progress"}],"stopRules":["Stop on opt-out, complaint, hard bounce, DNC, withdrawal, or permission loss.","Stop on a reply that needs human handling, a verified conversion, successful handoff, disqualification, or identity conflict.","Stop on stale evidence, an invalid destination, a missing strategy or message version, duplicate ownership, capacity failure, or a kill switch.","Stop on report ownership concern, deletion request, unsupported legal claim, or need for licensed advice."],"targetParticipant":"Authenticated customers who voluntarily upload an authorized credit report and request education.","valueExchange":"The customer supplies an authorized report and analysis permission in exchange for private organization, education, and a customer-controlled action plan.","versionDecisionRule":{"autonomousMaterialChange":false,"promote":"Promote after two 60-day windows each include 25 analysis-ready credit reports and ten verified saved action plans without privacy, claim, or needs-review regression.","requiredCompleteWindows":2,"retire":"Retire a claim, action path, or workflow after privacy/compliance failure or two complete windows without saved-plan progress.","revise":"Revise extraction, explanation, or action design when attributable confusion or failure evidence is correctable."}},"crm_owner_key":"vestblock_crm","cta_label":"Review my credit report and build an action plan","destination_mode":"public_route","destination_path":"/credit-upload","execution_mode":"no_send","expected_current_version":1,"expected_prior_fingerprint":"a5fbafef7c1a5d6479119fdced6ffdea","external_activation":"blocked","external_send_cap":0,"lifecycle_contract_json":{"cadence":["Immediate receipt.","Workflow status notifications.","Optional customer-selected 7/30/60/90 checkpoints."],"initialState":"uploaded","persistedEvents":["credit_report_uploaded system event","credit workflow status updates","analysis completed/failure/review tasks"],"persistedStates":["uploaded","extracting_text","text_extracted","analyzing","completed","failed","needs_review"],"recordAuthority":"credit_reports plus creditRepairWorkflow own uploaded, extracting_text, text_extracted, analyzing, completed, failed, and needs_review; later educational action states are not persisted.","stateNotes":{"action_in_progress":"action_in_progress is target-only and is not currently persisted by credit_reports/creditRepairWorkflow; post-analysis customer action events are missing.","action_plan_saved":"action_plan_saved is target-only and is not currently persisted by credit_reports/creditRepairWorkflow; post-analysis customer action events are missing.","analyzing":"analyzing is persisted by credit_reports/creditRepairWorkflow; post-analysis customer action events are missing.","checkpoint":"checkpoint is target-only and is not currently persisted by credit_reports/creditRepairWorkflow; post-analysis customer action events are missing.","completed":"completed is persisted by credit_reports/creditRepairWorkflow; post-analysis customer action events are missing.","customer_review":