ved.","The strategy may only create an internal operator research/review task in Gate 3B.","Do not route prospects to the legacy affiliate registration path."],"complianceLimits":["Do not guarantee funding, approval, credit-score change, deletion, income, investment return, property availability, government award, deal outcome, or transaction timing.","Keep analysis, matching, marketing, provider sharing, public display, and outreach permissions separate and purpose-specific.","Recheck global suppression, DNC, withdrawal, complaint, hard bounce, identity conflict, and destination health immediately before any later dispatch.","Do not conceal a referral, affiliate, commission, or other economic relationship.","Do not use the legacy affiliate path as evidence of current approval or terms."],"crossLaneRoutes":[{"handoff":"Route to the service-provider profile and bilateral introduction review after that strategy accepts.","requiresReceivingStrategyAcceptance":true,"to":"service_provider_network","trigger":"A single customer service need does not require recurring partner terms."},{"handoff":"Offer the role-specific profile path only after operator review.","requiresReceivingStrategyAcceptance":true,"to":"professional_participant_activation","trigger":"The prospective partner is better represented as one approved participant role."},{"handoff":"Offer DealVault only after the referral and record-access parties accept.","requiresReceivingStrategyAcceptance":true,"to":"dealvault_activation","trigger":"An approved referral requires controlled proof, milestone, or payout records."}],"disqualificationCriteria":["Unverifiable identity or capability.","Undisclosed compensation, conflict, regulatory uncertainty, poor or unsupported service evidence, attribution dispute, or prohibited service.","A request for guaranteed referrals, volume, revenue, preferred status, or concealment from the customer."],"eligibilityCriteria":["Organization and accountable contact can be verified.","