ted handoff ID and accepted event."},"owner_contract_json":{"automationRole":"vestblock_application","crmAuthority":"vestblock_crm","dispatchAuthority":"none_in_gate_3b","handoffRules":["Source jobs may ingest and score evidence only.","No contact occurs until a receiving customer strategy accepts the reviewed handoff."],"humanOwner":"A VestBlock operator owns contact review and every case or match acceptance.","recordOwner":"The application source orchestrator owns source facts; the CRM owns qualification once a canonical candidate exists."},"required_current_status":"draft","source_provenance_json":[{"kind":"gate_3a_registry_seed","observedAt":"2026-08-15","source":"Gate 3A canonical governed registry"},{"kind":"founder_approved_architecture","observedAt":"2026-08-15","source":"Gate 2 canonical strategy registry"},{"kind":"repository_consumer_audit","observedAt":"2026-08-15","source":"property source-events/market-state/runs/leads consumer audit"}],"strategy_key":"property_opportunity_discovery"},{"activation_blockers":["Version 1 remains draft and has no founder-approved activation event.","External send capacity is zero and no live-send approval exists.","Gate 3C canonical consumer binding is not implemented.","The public_sector_opportunities parent portfolio remains proposed rather than founder-approved for activation.","No approved customer destination or participant-specific readiness/bid-no-bid plan authority exists.","Every bid/no-bid decision, capability assertion, pricing decision, submission, teaming step, and government contact requires human approval."],"automation_owner_key":"operator_manual","contract_json":{"activationReadiness":{"blockers":["The parent portfolio remains proposed.","Canonical strategy-version binding is absent.","No customer destination or participant-plan authority exists.","External notifications and source scheduling are unapproved."],"readyElements":["Official opportunity ingestion and repository foundations exist.","The strategy is explicitly internal-only.","Human authority for bid/no-bid and submission is explicit."],"status":"blocked"},"cadenceSteps":[{"channels":["no_outreach"],"condition":"The official source, terms, and internal scheduler are healthy.","purpose":"Refresh official notice facts and archive expired or changed records.","timing":"daily while source access is healthy"},{"channels":["operator_task"],"condition":"A current notice has complete cited evidence and an identified review owner.","purpose":"Review source agreement, participant fit, deadline feasibility, and readiness gaps.","timing":"after current fit screening"},{"channels":["operator_task"],"condition":"The operator previously approved preparation and the official deadline remains current.","purpose":"Escalate an already approved internal readiness task.","timing":"before every material deadline"}],"channelSelectionRules":["Gate 3B is internal-only: ingest current official facts and create operator review tasks.","Do not send a digest, alert, government contact, or customer message until a public destination, opted-in participant fit, and strategy activation are separately approved.","n8n and channel adapters are not executors for this draft."],"complianceLimits":["Do not guarantee funding, approval, credit-score change, deletion, income, investment return, property availability, government award, deal outcome, or transaction timing.","Keep analysis, matching, marketing, provider sharing, public display, and outreach permissions separate and purpose-specific.","Recheck global suppression, DNC, withdrawal, complaint, hard bounce, identity conflict, and destination health immediately before any later dispatch.","Cite the current official source and never imply agency endorsement, award likelihood, eligibility, or submission.","Automated fit is screening evidence only; it is not a bid decision or capability assertion."],"crossLaneRoutes":[{"handoff":"Offer the guided readiness route without implying procurement eligibility.","requiresReceivingStrategyAcceptance":true,"to":"business_formation_readiness","trigger":"A future participant has foundational entity, registration, recordkeeping, or readiness gaps."},{"handoff":"Create a permissioned Capital intake without implying award or funding approval.","requiresReceivingStrategyAcceptance":true,"to":"capital_readiness_intake","trigger":"A participant separately requests preparation for a documented working-capital need."},{"handoff":"Hold the route until the partner strategy has an approved destination, terms, and disclosure authority.","requiresReceivingStrategyAcceptance":true,"to":"partner_referral_network","trigger":"A reviewed opportunity may require governed teaming or specialist capability."},{"handoff":"Offer DealVault only after authority and participant access are established.","requiresReceivingStrategyAcceptance":true,"to":"dealvault_activation","trigger":"An approved preparation or teaming effort needs controlled proof and milestone records."}],"disqualificationCriteria":["Expired, cancelled, duplicated, unsupported, or source-conflicted notice.","Ineligible entity, missing required registration, material capability/capacity gap, prohibited conflict, or unsupported certification claim.","Any request to imply agency endorsement, award likelihood, guaranteed eligibility, or autonomous submission."],"eligibilityCriteria":["Opportunity facts come from an official current source and include identifier, agency, notice type, dates, deadline, and applicable NAICS or scope.","Participant facts, when later used, are customer-submitted and include capability, registration, certification, capacity, conflicts, and document state.","Deadline feasibility, exclusions, source agreement, and operator ownership can be established before a fit decision."],"failureConditions":["Expired or conflicting source","Ineligible entity","Missing registration or certification","Insufficient capacity","Conflict","Unsupported claim","No participant plan authority"],"followupCadence":["Daily internal source refresh while official access and health are current.","Operator tasks follow verified deadlines and capacity.","No external weekly digest or participant cadence is active in Gate 3B."],"handoffRules":["SAM ingestion owns official facts only; it does not own participant communication or bid decisions.","A receiving readiness, Capital, partner, or DealVault strategy must accept the handoff and its own evidence/permission requirements."],"humanApprovalPoints":["Bid/no-bid","Capability and certification assertions","Pricing","Teaming and partner disclosure","Preparation scope","Submission","Government contact","Award/outcome verification"],"integrationDependencies":[{"evidence":"Application consumers do not yet persist or resolve canonical operating-strategy version IDs.","integration":"canonical strategy-version binding","requiredBeforeActivation":true,"status":"gate_3c"},{"evidence":"sam_opportunities and official-source ingestion/repository foundations exist, though they are dormant and unscheduled.","integration":"SAM opportunity subsystem","requiredBeforeActivation":true,"status":"available"},{"evidence":"No governed record joins an opportunity to participant capability, readiness gaps, operator decision, and accepted plan.","integration":"Participant public-sector readiness and bid/no-bid plan authority","requiredBeforeActivation":true,"status":"missing"},{"evidence":"The strategy intentionally has no public CTA and no approved external notification path.","integration":"Approved public destination and permissioned digest","requiredBeforeActivation":true,"status":"missing"}],"learningInputs":["official source","notice type","agency","NAICS/scope","fit/no-fit reason","deadline feasibility","readiness gap","bid/no-bid decision","submission result","debrief fact"],"nurtureRules":["This internal draft does not nurture participants.","A future digest must be participant-specific, fit-screened, source-cited, 