roduction acceptance and quality outcomes are not attributable.","External sends are unapproved."],"readyElements":["A role-aware public profile route exists.","Shared profile permissions and verification foundations exist.","This contract separates activation from post-active matching."],"status":"blocked"},"cadenceSteps":[{"channels":["website_notification"],"condition":"The profile is active and separately permitted for profile notifications.","purpose":"Reconfirm availability, service area, and capacity.","timing":"every 30 days while active"},{"channels":["website_notification","resend_email"],"condition":"A required credential or verification is approaching its freshness limit.","purpose":"Request current role-relevant evidence.","timing":"before credential expiry or at 90 days"},{"channels":["operator_task","website_notification","resend_email","outlook_graph","manual_phone_task"],"condition":"The operator approved the fit, each recipient permitted the selected channel, and compensation/conflicts are disclosed.","purpose":"Present a permissioned introduction to both parties.","timing":"after operator-approved bilateral fit review"}],"channelSelectionRules":["The shared activation strategy owns profile completion; this strategy may communicate only after an active-profile handoff.","Use a website notification for a reviewed match; use another channel only with channel-specific permission.","Every first introduction remains operator-approved; a provider profile never triggers autonomous outreach."],"complianceLimits":["Do not guarantee funding, approval, credit-score change, deletion, income, investment return, property availability, government award, deal outcome, or transaction timing.","Keep analysis, matching, marketing, provider sharing, public display, and outreach permissions separate and purpose-specific.","Recheck global suppression, DNC, withdrawal, complaint, hard bounce, identity conflict, and destination health immediately before any later dispatch.","Do not represent a provider as licensed, insured, endorsed, available, or suitable without current evidence and context.","Disclose any referral or compensation relationship and obtain customer permission before introduction."],"crossLaneRoutes":[{"handoff":"Return ownership to the shared activation service without preserving a pending match.","requiresReceivingStrategyAcceptance":true,"to":"professional_participant_activation","trigger":"The provider profile is incomplete, unverified, or no longer active."},{"handoff":"Offer a permissioned DealVault review with no automatic record sharing.","requiresReceivingStrategyAcceptance":true,"to":"dealvault_activation","trigger":"Both parties accept a project requiring controlled milestone, proof, or payout records."},{"handoff":"Propose a partner review only after a partner destination and terms authority exist.","requiresReceivingStrategyAcceptance":true,"to":"partner_referral_network","trigger":"The relationship requires governed recurring referral terms rather than a single service introduction."}],"disqualificationCriteria":["Identity or ownership conflict.","Required credential, insurance, capacity, or service evidence is missing or expired.","Unresolved complaint, prohibited service, undisclosed conflict, permission withdrawal, or requested guarantee of work."],"eligibilityCriteria":["An active participant profile exists for the approved provider role.","Identity, service area, capabilities, capacity, and current verification are complete.","Credentials, insurance, references, conflicts, and matching/communication permissions are present where relevant."],"failureConditions":["Expired required evidence","Capacity mismatch","Unresolved complaint or dispute","Repeated nonresponse","Poor verified quality","Undisclosed conflict or compensation"],"followupCadence":["Capacity and high-volatility criteria review every 30 days.","Credential and broader profile review no later than 90 days or governing expiry.","A reviewed introduction receives only the customer-approved, channel-permitted follow-up and stops on either party response."],"handoffRules":["Professional participant activation owns every pre-active state and completion reminder.","Service provider network owns only accepted active profiles, current capacity/credential review, and operator-approved service introductions."],"humanApprovalPoints":["Role and identity verification","License/insurance representation","Every first introduction","Compensation/referral disclosure","Complaint and quality review"],"integrationDependencies":[{"evidence":"Application consumers do not yet persist or resolve canonical operating-strategy version IDs.","integration":"canonical strategy-version binding","requiredBeforeActivation":true,"status":"gate_3c"},{"evidence":"Role-aware participant profile and permission fields exist.","integration":"Shared participant-profile service","requiredBeforeActivation":true,"status":"available"},{"evidence":"No canonical role-specific freshness and credential event stream persists this lifecycle.","integration":"Service-provider capacity and credential lifecycle","requiredBeforeActivation":true,"status":"missing"},{"evidence":"No governed record currently proves operator review, acceptance by both parties, completion, quality, and complaint resolution.","integration":"Bilateral service introduction and quality outcome","requiredBeforeActivation":true,"status":"missing"}],"learningInputs":["provider role","service need","geography","capacity","credential freshness","fit decision","response time","bilateral acceptance","completion","quality","complaint","repeat demand"],"nurtureRules":["Nurture only current profile, capacity, credential, or accepted-match gaps.","Do not promise opportunities, lead volume, revenue, preferred status, or customer endorsement."],"objective":"Maintain current service-provider capabilities and route a qualified customer need to an operator-reviewed, permissioned introduction.","